    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81262.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 68,
    "turn_text": "One is I think that it is absolutely valuable for anybody that wants to be in an elected position to have at least volunteered for a campaign for some type of substantial amount of time and work all the areas of a campaign or at least as much as they could so that they can know exactly what they're getting themselves into because I did that. I worked for campaigns for many, many years and I've worked every part of the campaign and before I ever decided to run for office and that helped me a lot. Be tried and tested because I know that as organizers, we, you know, we have this moxie and we have this purge, we have this boldness, you know, and oftentimes we're the ones who are going to go chop at the protest and we're going to sleep on the floor in somebody's basement because we don't have the money to do all the things. So, you know, we're, you know, we're greedy and, you know, all of that. Yes. And we're cool with that. So when this money comes to you once you get elected, have you been tried and tested yet to know that when the money comes, do you know that you would say no? Like do you know you would say no over and over and over because they're going to come at you 75 times in a year are you sure that you can say no. So those are just a couple of the like the low hanging fruit things but then the other is knowing who you are you have to really really know who you are because you have because that's what you have to. You have to be that and you have to sell that because remember you are the one that leads and so you leave people who have to follow in order for people to follow they have to believe your message and you oftentimes have to go it alone. So can you go it alone when all of your colleagues are saying one thing and you believe in your heart another. You know, so like being tried and tested, I believe is absolutely true. So when you know who you are, you can fight unapologetically and no matter what anybody says to you, you can stand firm.",
