    "turn_text": "We are grateful for you. Love you, Sis. Thank you so much. Look y'all, the work is gonna look different. Especially for us black women and marginalized folks, we need to make sure that self-care, real rest and renewal is always on the agenda. But I already know there's no quitting us, so we ain't gonna start now. That's it for today, but never for tomorrow. Undistracted is a production of the media and our friends at the Wonder Media Network. Our producers are Vanessa Handy, Brittany Martinez, and Alia Yates. Our editors are Grace Lynch and Maddie Foley. Thanks also to Natalia Ramirez and Sarah Colley. Our executive producers at the media are Cindy Levy and myself. And our executive producer at Wonder Media Network is Jenny Kaplan. You can follow me at Ms. Pack Yeti on all social media and our incredible team at The Media. Subscribe to Undistracted, and y'all, please do rate and review us on Apple Podcasts, Spotify, or any place you get your favorite podcast. This week, thanks for listening, thanks for being, and especially this week. Thanks for doing. I'm Brittany Packner Cunningham. Let's go get free, y'all.",
